{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-06T05:08:19.569Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"889f14fd4f565135be7f7e17","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1663","claim:pm-gh1674","lineage:pm-gh1663","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1663+pm-gh1674","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1663","claim:pm-gh1674","lineage:pm-gh1663","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-06T05:08:19.569Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-06T05:08:19.566Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"A stable-shape envelope that pads unrequested members with empty values turns 'not requested' into 'empty', which reads as evidence of absence. Two separate defects hid it: the producer padded the siblings, and the receipt for explicit --fields registered an empty material set, so it could never report the omission. Fix both sides: emit only selected members, and register the populated siblings a nested selector left out as <facet>.<member> receipt groups with a narrow restore_with. Treat null, false and [] as immaterial, so a receipt never lists a sibling that has nothing to withhold. TOON keeps its sparse policy, and the receipt is what disambiguates an absent group there."}]}],"before_hash":"d92102167ed499590640fde5d577cf6e35ee497ad66457f8c595ea5d34998b5c","after_hash":"abcaff2869dd0aa0a8408670675ac8480cd15a803b19ceb6e4a23d5ef55635da","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"78dd6147b44ea6d1a81b9d619932c57ab19ea511c667a4732a7efc238e29ce81"}
